1
00:59:33,604 --> 00:59:35,535
What was she doing at
the head of those stairs?

2
00:59:36,701 --> 00:59:38,045
That was my fault.

3
00:59:38,246 --> 00:59:41,583
They heard a strange noise, heavy pounding
in one of the rooms on the third floor.

4
00:59:41,613 --> 00:59:43,753
- We all heard it.
- I wanted to see what it was.

5
00:59:43,783 --> 00:59:46,526
Judie, she wouldn't
let me go out by myself.

6
00:59:46,874 --> 00:59:49,137
I made her stay on the balcony.

7
00:59:49,385 --> 00:59:52,900
- What about your new butler?
- Well, he's in his room I suppose.

8
00:59:53,579 --> 00:59:55,618
- Oh, Miss Patterson.
- Yes?

9
00:59:55,648 --> 00:59:57,017
Did you know what happened here?

10
00:59:57,489 --> 01:00:01,236
No sir, but I heard the
screams, I went to call Warner.

11
01:00:01,598 --> 01:00:03,414
We have rooms on the same floor.

12
01:00:03,747 --> 01:00:07,293
He wasn't in his room,
his bed hasn't been slept in.

13
01:00:07,903 --> 01:00:10,505
If Miss Patterson heard the screams,
Warner could certainly hear them.

14
01:00:11,137 --> 01:00:13,944
- You're quite right sir, I heard them.
- Oh, you did?

15
01:00:14,422 --> 01:00:17,087
- And where were you?
- Outside on the grounds.

16
01:00:17,636 --> 01:00:20,401
- Miss Holland is been murdered.
- No?

17
01:00:21,174 --> 01:00:23,600
So you're surprised, shocked.

18
01:00:24,890 --> 01:00:26,899
Well, I've seen better performances.

19
01:00:27,872 --> 01:00:31,472
I remember you now,
your name is not Warner.

20
01:00:32,214 --> 01:00:34,354
I've got a circular in my
office with your picture on it.

21
01:00:35,080 --> 01:00:38,363
The Chicago police not so long ago were
hunting for you in connection with a robbery.

22
01:00:38,509 --> 01:00:42,079
You're right again sir, and they found me
and they tried me and I proved my innocence.

23
01:00:42,109 --> 01:00:44,991
- And I was acquitted.
- That could've been a lucky break.

24
01:00:46,112 --> 01:00:47,926
Where were you when
this child was killed?

25
01:00:47,950 --> 01:00:49,542
I told you
before sir, outside.

26
01:00:50,029 --> 01:00:52,308
- What you doing there?
- I was following you.

27
01:00:52,532 --> 01:00:54,641
I saw you leaving the house
and seemed that you were hunting...

28
01:00:54,671 --> 01:00:56,387
someone, I thought you
might need some help.

29
01:00:56,542 --> 01:00:59,400
Oh yes sir, I followed your
flashlight down through the trees.

30
01:00:59,702 --> 01:01:03,858
Then it disappeared and then suddenly
as I was staring out into the darkness...

31
01:01:03,888 --> 01:01:06,214
I was struck by something
on to the back of the head.

32
01:01:06,469 --> 01:01:10,803
Next thing I knew, I was lying on the
ground, I realized I'd been knocked out.

33
01:01:11,429 --> 01:01:13,013
I wish you had been knocked out.

34
01:01:13,445 --> 01:01:15,762
For then we'd found you
with your mask still on your face!

35
01:01:16,380 --> 01:01:17,740
You were hit here in this house...

36
01:01:18,073 --> 01:01:20,514
with this poker as you were rushing
down those stairs after that child...

37
01:01:20,544 --> 01:01:23,519
Oh no sir, you can't
pin this on me, I'm not the Bat!

38
01:01:23,766 --> 01:01:27,551
I've never killed, I couldn't kill,
I won't take the rap for this!

39
01:01:58,428 --> 01:01:59,355
Well doctor...

40
01:02:00,352 --> 01:02:02,414
we have another case
for the county coroner.

41
01:02:04,091 --> 01:02:05,683
You see, the Bat came back.

42
01:02:07,807 --> 01:02:09,645
Why did you come back doctor?

43
01:02:12,094 --> 01:02:16,018
Well I, I had an accident
about a mile down the road.

44
01:02:16,760 --> 01:02:20,158
The right rear wheel of my car
came off and I plunged into the ditch.

45
01:02:20,621 --> 01:02:24,121
This was the nearest house
so I came here to call for help.

46
01:02:25,696 --> 01:02:27,906
I thought I'd find you around Andy.

47
01:02:32,146 --> 01:02:33,668
Physician, heal thyself.

48
01:02:36,217 --> 01:02:39,091
You're must've been hit by
something on the back of your head.

49
01:02:39,593 --> 01:02:42,274
- I told you I had an accident.
- So you did doctor.

50
01:02:43,131 --> 01:02:44,097
So you did.

51
01:02:46,360 --> 01:02:47,511
I could be wrong.
